Static TURN, CI/CD, richer schema.org, error boundaries; fix theme script

- Fix React 19 "script inside component" console warning: load the
  pre-hydration color-scheme init from an external /public/theme-init.js
  instead of an inline <script>
- ICE route: add STATIC TURN mode (TURN_URLS / TURN_USERNAME / TURN_CREDENTIAL)
  so a free no-credit-card provider (Metered Open Relay) enables TURN with no
  coturn, no VM and no Redis; coturn ephemeral mode and STUN-only still work
- Docs: no-credit-card deployment path (Upstash + Open Relay + Render PeerJS);
  CONFIGURATION updated with the new TURN vars
- CI/CD: GitHub Actions workflow (install, generate blog, type-check, lint,
  build) on push/PR to main
- SEO: BreadcrumbList JSON-LD on blog posts and tool pages; richer BlogPosting
  schema (publisher logo, articleSection, dateModified)
- Production hardening: route-level error boundary (error.tsx) and root
  global-error.tsx

